# Release hygiene — these must never re-enter the public record.
# The figures are printed in the paper; figures/ ships the scripts that
# regenerate them from 02_data/, not the renders. Font binaries are not ours
# to redistribute and are not needed to reproduce any value.
figures/out/
figures/fonts/
*.ttf
*.otf
